                {
                  "formattedValue": "16 November 2026 update: Full original counterexample to the sum of all three Kato kernels passed source-first, independent and adversarial review at the original allowed index n=1. The binary quasilinear function-field convention, anisotropy, all-rational-parameter norm/residue obstruction and separately positive n=0 proposition were checked. The mixed generator is explicitly prior ALO work; no firstness, all-index failure or final-typeset-body equivalence is claimed. One unchanged native finite algebra diagnostic passed; it is not a cohomology decision oracle. No repair, narrowing or qualifying follow-up. Native version 1.0.0 is metadata; the PDF prints no numeric version. Canonical remains blank until publication and live verification. Scientific evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/4437b1f3b853983daf0616bfb1e8af23b542c647/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-clearance-23444050-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\nComplete 4-page manuscript and 299-line controlling TeX acquired with unchanged checksum-verified native files. Native record created 18 October 2026 at 00:29:32 UTC; declared publication date is recorded separately. Independent source-first scope and adversarial reviews are frozen; root's own source-first validation is pending. No scientific disposition or public page approved; canonical remains blank. Source evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/438ac3f6cca7a927c51c77d2c8d939480c1c2df0/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/source153-155-sol-20261116/SOURCE_PACKET_FINAL.json",
