                {
                  "formattedValue": "Full original Zenodo version 1.0 passed substantive root review plus independent scope and adversarial reviews. The signed origin-pedal/origin-antipedal area product is proved for every admitted least odd period with a strict confocal elliptical caustic, including stars; real intersections remain finite. Opposite complex endpoints and the four-period counterexample are handled. No substantive gap, repair or narrowing found. This is internal AI-assisted review, not external human refereeing or a historical-priority certificate. Public article is pending; canonical remains blank. Evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/65256bfa6661c2965226bfaa1ca65ce6c551904f/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-clearance-23334001-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\nComplete 5-page manuscript and 367-line controlling TeX acquired with unchanged checksum-verified native files. Native record created 13 October 2026 at 06:36:40 UTC; declared publication date is recorded separately. Independent source-first scope and adversarial reviews are frozen; root's own source-first validation is pending. No scientific disposition or public page approved; canonical remains blank. Source evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/438ac3f6cca7a927c51c77d2c8d939480c1c2df0/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/source153-155-sol-20261116/SOURCE_PACKET_FINAL.json",
